prompt:
Create one original true-transparent RGBA production spritesheet for Moxie Capwell's right-facing basketball celebration. Match supplied Moxie portrait and gameplay references as strict identity guides: adult human woman, pale skin, lavender-purple eyes, long thick lavender high ponytail with small gold tie, mature athletic build, purple-and-silver uniform with white side panels, purple wristbands and purple high-top shoes. Keep same face, hair/tie, kit and body proportions in every pose.

1990s arcade basketball pixel-cel art, crisp clean outlines. Canvas exactly 1536x1024, five columns by two rows, exactly ten distinct complete full-body Moxie poses in row-major order. Give every pose wide transparent margins within its cell; full ponytail and shoes visible, no touching canvas or cell boundaries. Transparent alpha-zero background.
Moxie alone, separate basketball not drawn, no opponent. This is a joyful composed sports celebration after a score: mature confident smile, not exaggerated or childish, no props. No ball, hoop, court, floor, shadow, glow, effects, text, labels, or scenery.
Pose sequence:
0 balanced stance, smile begins, hands relaxed;
1 lift both forearms with quiet excitement;
2 raise one fist at shoulder height and smile;
3 raise both hands overhead in triumph;
4 hold the overhead celebration, feet planted;
5 lower arms outward while turning slightly toward teammates offscreen;
6 tap one fist to chest, appreciative expression;
7 small confident step and nod;
8 settle with one hand raised in a calm wave;
9 return to balanced relaxed stance, smiling.
All figures are full-body and poses visibly distinct but connected, preserve Moxie's identity and anatomy.
